  {%- case gem_handle -%}
    {%- when 'emerald' -%}
      <p>Origin is one of the defining factors in an Emerald’s value. Two stones may appear similar at first glance, yet differ significantly in price based on where they formed — and that origin should always be disclosed and independently verified for premium pieces.</p>
