        </tr>
        <tr style="background: #fdfaf5;"><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;"><strong>Kashmir</strong></td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">The benchmark</td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Velvety cornflower blue</td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">₹4,00,000+</td></tr>
