        <tr style="background: #fdfaf5;"><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;"><strong>Thailand</strong></td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Deep &amp; dark</td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Dark blue to blue-black</td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">₹1,200 – ₹80,000+</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Beyond origin, price is shaped by colour depth and saturation, treatment status (untreated stones command a premium), clarity, cut quality, and size. As always: a smaller stone with commanding colour and natural stability will outperform a larger, dull one.</p>
      <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
