        <p style="margin:8px 0 0;"><strong>Best Metal:</strong> Silver or Panchdhatu, traditionally. White Gold when astrologically advised.</p>
      </div>
    {%- when 'opal' -%}
      <p>Opal's value is shaped above all by its play-of-colour — the intensity, variety, and liveliness of light moving within the stone. Origin matters significantly, not only for value but for long-term stability and suitability for astrological wear.</p>
