        </tr>
        <tr style="background: #fdfaf5;"><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;"><strong>Australia</strong></td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Strong, stable rainbow play</td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">₹600 – ₹50,000+</td><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Preferred</td></tr>
